{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-06", "prepared_on": "2026-11-06", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-06</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> GPT-6 Cyber: Advancing the frontier of aligned cybersecurity agents<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">GPT-6 Cyber：推進對齊型資安代理的前沿</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI introduces GPT-6 Cyber, a cybersecurity model for finding exploitable vulnerabilities and developing fixes, trained to stay within authorized scope.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 推出資安模型 GPT-6 Cyber，可找出可被利用的漏洞並開發修補方案，訓練目標是只在授權範圍內行動。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-cyber\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Claude AI can plug directly into your bank account<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude 可直接連結你的銀行帳戶</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic's new Personal Finance feature connects Claude to bank and card accounts via Plaid, so you can ask where your money went this month.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 推出 Personal Finance 功能，透過 Plaid 連結銀行與信用卡帳戶，使用者可直接問 Claude「這個月錢花到哪去了」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1027652/anthropic-claude-plaid-personal-finance\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> OpenAI is stepping back from NDAs for data center projects<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 資料中心專案將不再與公職人員簽保密協議</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">After midterms where voters voiced opposition to data center expansion, OpenAI announced new community commitments, including no NDAs with public officials.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在期中選舉中選民明確反對資料中心擴張後，OpenAI 宣布新的社區承諾，其中包括不再與公職人員簽訂保密協議。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1028454/openai-data-center-nda\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> OpenAI to acquire Pierre Computer Company, Inc.<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 將收購 Pierre Computer Company</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI will acquire Pierre Computer Company, expanding Codex's tools for building, understanding, and reviewing code.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 將收購 Pierre，整合其 Git 版本控制與程式碼審查技術，擴充 Codex 的開發能力，交易金額未公開。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/openai-to-acquire-pierre\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Perplexity launches its own take on AI agents for work<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Perplexity 推出自家職場 AI 代理</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Perplexity's new always-on \"Teammates\" can take on multiple roles in a workspace while pulling in existing projects, skills, and memory.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Perplexity 推出常駐式「Teammates」，可在工作空間中擔任多種角色，並沿用既有專案、技能與記憶，直接對標 OpenAI 與 Anthropic。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1028302/perplexity-teammates-ai-agents-work\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Meta says US users can now video chat with their Muse AI avatar<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta：美國用戶現可與 Muse AI 虛擬形象視訊通話</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta's AI agent can now take calls as a customizable animated avatar, ahead of the launch of a Tamagotchi-like wearable.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta 的 AI 代理 Muse 現在能以可自訂的動畫形象接聽視訊通話，為即將推出的類電子雞穿戴裝置鋪路。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/meta-says-us-users-can-now-video-chat-with-their-muse-ai-avatar/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Russian hackers APT29 launch large-scale watering-hole attacks stealing iOS and Android data<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">俄羅斯駭客 APT29 發動大規模水坑式攻擊，竊取 iOS 與 Android 裝置帳密及資料</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Sekoia disclosed \"Poisoned Source\", a campaign that compromises legitimate sites and delivers different exploit chains by OS and browser version. It is likely the work of APT29.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Sekoia 揭露水坑式攻擊活動 Poisoned Source，攻擊者入侵合法網站，並依受害者的系統與瀏覽器版本投遞不同漏洞利用鏈，研判很可能出自 APT29。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180250\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Debian and Ubuntu patch high-risk APT flaw that lets a man-in-the-middle swap packages for root access<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Debian、Ubuntu 修補高風險 APT 套件漏洞，中間人可替換套件取得 root 權限</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The authentication bypass CVE-2026-109518 lets an attacker who controls HTTP traffic swap verified packages and run arbitrary code as root. Other APT-based distros may be affected.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">驗證繞過漏洞 CVE-2026-109518 讓能控制 HTTP 傳輸流量的攻擊者，在特定條件下替換已驗證的套件並以 root 權限執行程式碼，其他採用 APT 的發行版也可能受影響。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180262\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> OpenAI reveals personalization bottleneck: models still struggle to use past conversations (LifeVal)<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 揭露 AI 助理個人化瓶頸，模型仍難善用過往對話</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">On the LifeVal everyday-task benchmark, even assistants with access to past ChatGPT chats often miss needed personal details. They met only 33.33% of criteria that required history.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 的日常任務基準 LifeVal 顯示，即使 AI 助理能存取過往對話，仍常漏掉所需的個人資訊，在需要歷史對話的評分條件上平均僅達標 33.33%。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180267\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Airbnb says it's launching an AI travel agent in the first half of 2027<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Airbnb 宣布 2027 上半年推出 AI 旅遊代理</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Airbnb's upcoming AI agent will help travelers plan trips, compare options, manage bookings, and get assistance throughout their stay.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Airbnb 的 AI 代理將協助旅客規劃行程、比較選項、管理訂單，並在住宿期間提供協助。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/airbnb-says-its-launching-an-ai-travel-agent-in-the-first-half-of-2027/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}